idism</article-title><source>Int. J. Audiol.</source><year>1983</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>404</fpage><lpage>409</lpage></element-citation><mixed-citation id="mc-CR11" publication-type="journal">Debruyne, F., Vanderschueren-Lodeweyckx, M. &#x00026; Bastijns, P. Hearing in congenital hypothyroidism. <italic>Int. J. Audiol.</italic><bold>22</bold>, 404&#x02013;409 (1983).</mixed-citation></citation-alternatives></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation-alternatives><element-citation id="ec-CR12" publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kooistra</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Crawford</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>van Baar</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Brouwers</surname><given-names>EP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pop</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neonatal effects of maternal hypothyroxinemia during early pregnancy</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><year>2006</year><volume>117</volume><fpage>161</fpage><lpage>167</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16396874</pub-id>
